  "sourceNotes": [
    "Geometry is traced from the supplied semantic raster; no prior box geometry reused.",
    "The 9 m footprint width is a proposed design scale, not a dimension recovered from the book.",
    "Image top is +Y, image right is +X, front is -Y; see pixelTransform for exact calibration.",
    "Uniform wall thickness is the median measured full width along each traced centerline.",
    "Room floor contours include furniture areas. Interior paths trace actual adjacent room-pair Voronoi boundaries clipped by the measured footprint; no T-divider or bath-bedroom adjacency is required. Exterior centerline is inset from its traced footprint by the measured median half-thickness.",
    "Door heights, window elevation, wall height and furniture heights are explicit design values.",
    "Semantic image alignment with the beauty illustration must be assessed separately; it is not assumed exact.",
    "Localized bathroom revision: only bath exterior/floor, tub/washstand and rear window change. Non-bath exterior opening station metadata is recomputed to preserve original world anchors. Diagram underlay is model-derived; raw generated background is not adopted."
  ],
